			(property "Description" "NeoPixel connector pin-order config block. Solder-bridge field: routes DIN / V+ / GND (left) to connector pins P1 / P2 / P3 (right) in any permutation. Footprint ships with default bridges DIN-P1, V+-P2, GND-P3; cut and re-bridge to match the LED board's SH1.0 order. No internal electrical connection - bridging is physical on the PCB."
